<title>GREECE: BOARD OF GREEK FOREX CLUB COMES TO A BODY, GEORGIOU IS NEW PRES.</title>
<headline>BOARD OF GREEK FOREX CLUB COMES TO A BODY, GEORGIOU IS NEW PRES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The new board of directors of the</p>
<p>Forex Club Hellas (Association Cambiste Hellenique) came to a</p>
<p>body on Wednesday, the club said.</p>
<p>The board of directors is made up of:</p>
<p> President:	    George Georgiou, Bayerische Vereinsbank</p>
<p> Vice-President:     Vassilis Dagritzikos, Commercial Bank of</p>
<p>			   Greece</p>
<p>General secretary:  Krystallo Mirchou, Bank of Greece</p>
<p>Financial affairs:  Alex Papandreou, National Bank of Greece</p>
<p> Public relations    Athanassios Hasapis, NatWest</p>
<p>&amp; ACI liaison:</p>
<p>Training activites: Dimitris Papaioannou, American Express</p>
<p>Social activities:  Charalambos Kolezas, Bank of America</p>
<p> Members:		Antonis Gounaris, Citibank</p>
<p>			   Konstandinos Kamaris, Midland Bank</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
